# Portkey

> Portkey is a production stack for Gen AI builders, equipping AI teams with everything they need to go to production - Gateway, Observability, Guardrails, Governance, and Prompt Management, all in one platform.

Portkey enables AI teams to access 1,600+ LLMs via a unified API, eliminating the need to integrate with multiple providers. It provides comprehensive observability with detailed logging, real-time performance metrics, and cost monitoring to optimize AI operations. Portkey is trusted by 3000+ teams, from Fortune 500s to startups, processing billions of tokens daily.

## Core Features

- [AI Gateway](https://portkey.ai/features/ai-gateway): Enterprise-grade AI Gateway connecting to 250+ LLMs and providers across different modalities via a unified API with smart routing, caching, and secure key management.

- [Observability](https://portkey.ai/features/observability): Full-stack LLM observability with real-time insights, performance metrics, and debugging tools to monitor and optimize every LLM interaction.

- [Model Catalog](https://portkey.ai/features/model-catalog): Access to 1,600+ LLMs through a unified interface for streamlined development and experimentation.

- [MCP](https://portkey.ai/features/mcp): Model Context Protocol client for building AI agents that can use 800+ tools with an open, community-driven standard.

- [AI Agents](https://portkey.ai/features/agents): Tools and infrastructure to build, deploy, and manage production-ready AI agents.

- [Guardrails](https://portkey.ai/features/guardrails): Network-level guardrails to ensure secure and compliant AI operations, including PII redaction and content filtering.

- [Prompt Management](https://portkey.ai/features/prompt-management): Collaborative prompt management system to create, version, and optimize prompts for improved AI outputs.

## Solutions

- [Enterprise](https://portkey.ai/for/enterprise): Comprehensive AI governance solution for enterprise teams with role-based access control, audit logs, and SSO.

- [Small & Medium Businesses](https://portkey.ai/for/sme): Tailored solutions for small and medium-sized businesses to implement and scale AI capabilities.

- [RBAC](https://portkey.ai/for/rbac): Role-based access control for managing team permissions and secure collaboration.

- [Cost Management](https://portkey.ai/for/manage-and-attribute-costs): Tools to track, attribute, and optimize AI spending across teams and use cases.

- [Model Access Management](https://portkey.ai/for/manage-access-for-ai-models-and-providers): Controls for managing which teams can access specific AI models and providers.

- [Network-Level Guardrails](https://portkey.ai/for/network-level-guardrails): Advanced protection mechanisms implemented at the network level to ensure secure AI interactions.

- [Organization-Wide Audit Logs](https://portkey.ai/for/org-wide-audit-logs): Comprehensive logging system for tracking all activities across your organization's AI usage.

- [Azure Integration](https://portkey.ai/for/azure): Dedicated support for Microsoft Azure OpenAI models and services.

- [Education](https://portkey.ai/for/education): Special pricing and features for educational institutions.

- [Claude Code Integration](https://portkey.ai/for/claude-code): Support for Anthropic's Claude Code, an agentic command line tool for AI-assisted coding.

- [Security & Compliance](https://portkey.ai/features/security-compliance): HIPAA and GDPR compliant platform with enterprise-grade security features.

